  "reason": "Existing evidence shows config_010 (0.639 accuracy) and config_020 (0.635 accuracy) are top performers, both using resnet50 image encoder. This experiment tests scgpt RNA encoder with transformer aggregation and weighted fusion, which could improve accuracy by leveraging complex interactions between modalities. While config_027 uses resnet50 image encoder (similar to config_010), it introduces transformer aggregation (more complex than avgpool) and weighted fusion (vs concat). This balances exploration of aggregation methods with cost: estimated at ~8 GPU hours (similar to config_020's 7.02), allowing remaining experiments to explore other promising directions."
}

